# Retired catalog / leftover URLs.
#
# GitHub Pages cannot emit HTTP 301. HTML stubs stay as 200 + meta-refresh +
# robots noindex so Ahrefs stops scoring them as soft-404 Errors until the
# edge rules below are live.
#
# This file is NOT applied by Cloudflare automatically. The zone proxies
# GitHub Pages; it is not a Cloudflare Pages project. Import these rows as
# Bulk Redirects, or add equivalent Single Redirects on islandmountain.io
# (Rules -> Redirect Rules). The zone already has www -> apex. Group by
# destination so the Free-plan Single Redirect count stays small.
#
# Do not point the leftover `islandmountain` Workers Builds project at this
# repo as the site host. That worker is a Hello-world stub; Git deploys run
# `npx wrangler versions upload` at repo root and fail with no entry-point.
#
# Homepage RFC 9727 Link headers are a separate Response Header Transform Rule
# (not a redirect). Payload: tools/cloudflare-homepage-link-headers.json.
# GitHub Pages cannot emit custom headers; _headers files are ignored here.
#
# After the rules are enabled:
#   curl -sI https://islandmountain.io/pricing.html
# should show HTTP 301 and a Location header, not 200.

